<title>POLAND: Polish central bank sells PLN 401 mln of NBP-bills.</title>
<headline>Polish central bank sells PLN 401 mln of NBP-bills.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland sold 200 million zlotys of its 182-day bills and 201 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills, the central bank said.</p>
<p>The bank sold 182-day bills at an unchanged average yield of 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>Average yield of the longer 273-day paper was also unchanged at 22.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 2 653 9700</p>
</text>
